# ============================================
# Figma2Storybook - Credentials Configuration
# ============================================
#
# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: This application does NOT use .env files!
#
# All credentials must be configured through the UI:
# 1. Click the "Settings" button in the application
# 2. Enter your Figma Access Token
# 3. Enter your OpenRouter API Key
# 4. Click "Save & Close"
#
# Credentials are stored securely in your browser's localStorage.
#
# Required Credentials:
# ---------------------
# 1. Figma Access Token
#    Get from: https://www.figma.com/settings
#    Format: figd_...
#
# 2. OpenRouter API Key
#    Get from: https://openrouter.ai/keys
#    Format: sk-or-...
#
